    "title": "What channel is Reds Opening Day? How to watch Reds-Red Sox",
    "text": "Updated March 25, 2026, 2:58 p.m. ETThe Cincinnati Reds return to the diamond for Opening Day on March 26.The home team faces the Boston Red Sox in its first game of the 2026 regular season at Great American Ball Park. Tickets to the Reds' home opener are available for purchase online starting around $126 through SeatGeek, the team's official ticketing partner.Not planning on catching the action in person? Here's how to tune into the Reds' home opener on TV.Who do the Reds play on Opening Day?The Boston Red Sox.Reds Opening Day game time4:10 p.m. ET.How to watch, stream Reds vs. Red Sox on Opening DayThe Cincinnati Reds opted to have MLB produce and distribute their game broadcasts in 2026. However, in a March 9 press release, the Reds announced a \"number of\" regular-season games will broadcast on Fox 19 (WXIX-TV) in Cincinnati. The first game under the new agreement will be the Reds' Opening Day matchup.Spectrum also added channels 304 and 1304, titled \"MLB Cincinnati Reds,\" to its lineup for Cincinnati-area subscribers.Fans in the Reds' regional TV territory can watch all locally distributed Reds games via cable and satellite providers or stream digitally on REDS.TV through the MLB app. Fans who live outside the regional area can still watch by subscribing to MLB.TV. Visit mlb.com/reds for more information.How to listen to Reds vs. Red Sox on Opening DayYou can listen to Reds vs. Red Sox on the Cincinnati-area Reds Radio Network affiliates: WLW-AM 700 and WKFS-FM 94.5.When does the 2026 MLB season start?The first game of the 2026 MLB season will be played in San Francisco. The New York Yankees face the San Francisco Giants at Oracle Park on March 25. The first pitch is slated for 8:05 p.m. ET.The game will be available for streaming exclusively on Netflix.When is Opening Day 2026?Twenty-four teams play on MLB Opening Day on March 26, with the first game kicking off between the Pittsburgh Pirates and New York Mets at Citi Field in New York. The first pitch is set for 1:15 p.m. ET.MLB Opening Day schedule 2026While the Yankees and Giants kick things off a day earlier, MLB's traditional Opening Day features 24 of the 30 teams. The remainder of the MLB's Opening Day games will be played March 27.Here's the full schedule for MLB Opening Week through March 27.Thursday, March 26 (Opening Day)Pittsburgh Pirates at New York Mets (1:15 p.m.)Chicago White Sox at Milwaukee Brewers (2:10 p.m.)Washington Nationals at Chicago Cubs (2:20 p.m.)Minnesota Twins at Baltimore Orioles (3:05 p.m.)Boston Red Sox at Cincinnati Reds (4:10 p.m.)Los Angeles Angels at Houston Astros (4:10 p.m.)Detroit Tigers at San Diego Padres (4:10 p.m.)Texas Rangers at Philadelphia Phillies (4:15 p.m.)Tampa Bay Rays at St. Louis Cardinals (4:15 p.m.)Arizona Diamondbacks at Los Angeles Dodgers (8:30 p.m.)Cleveland Guardians at Seattle Mariners (10:10 p.m.)Friday, March 27Yankees at Giants (4:35 p.m.)Athletics at Toronto Blue Jays (7:07 p.m.)Colorado Rockies at Miami Marlins (7:10 p.m.)Kansas City Royals at Atlanta Braves (7:15 p.m.)Angels at Astros (8:10 p.m.)Tigers at Padres (9:40 p.m.)Guardians at Mariners (9:40 p.m.)Diamondbacks at Dodgers (10:10 p.m.)",
